---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Profiles
description: The six domain profiles and their build order.
---
<div class="container py-5">
  <h1 class="mb-3">Profiles</h1>
  <p class="lead">Each profile carries the same five artifacts, so the pattern is learned once: a README, JSON Schemas, a context fragment, a crosswalk, and examples.</p>

  {% for b in profiles.built %}
  <div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
      <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start flex-wrap gap-2">
        <div>
          <h2 class="h5 mb-1">{{ b.name }} <span class="badge text-bg-success align-middle">implemented</span></h2>
          <p class="mb-1 small">{{ b.schemas | length }} schemas, {{ b.codelists | length }} code lists.</p>
          <p class="mb-0 small text-body-secondary">Source standard: {{ b.source }}</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/profiles/{{ b.slug }}/" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">Browse</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}

  {% if profiles.planned | length %}
  <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Planned, in dependency order</h2>
  <p class="small text-body-secondary">Build order follows dependency, not interest.</p>
  <div class="list-group mb-4">
    {% for p in profiles.planned %}
    <div class="list-group-item">
      <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start flex-wrap gap-2">
        <div>
          <h3 class="h6 mb-1"><code>{{ p.slug }}</code> — {{ p.title }}</h3>
          <p class="mb-0 small text-body-secondary">Source standard: {{ p.source }}<br>Depends on: <code>{{ p.depends }}</code></p>
        </div>
        <span class="badge text-bg-secondary">planned</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <div class="alert alert-secondary small mb-4">
    <strong>All seven domain profiles are implemented.</strong> What comes next — discovery,
    alerts, permits, elections — is tracked in
    <a href="{{ site.repo }}/blob/main/ROADMAP.md">ROADMAP.md</a>, along with the open
    questions on geospatial data and the scope of service requests.
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>
